            "review_title": "Review at Nestling Cafe",
            "review_text": "Kat S\n3 contributions\n0\nChild-friendly family cafe at Empire City\nAug 2025 • Family\nMy family and I were looking for a cafe while visiting Empire City, and stumbled across this place. We had some delicious noodles for lunch and a good coffee and drinks. There was a shelf of kids toys and books that kept the children pre-occupied. Very child-friendly and chill cafe.\nInsider tip:\nChild-friendly and family friendly. A nice shelf of toys and books to keep the kids occupied.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 20, 2025",
