            "review_title": "Review at Nestling Cafe",
            "review_text": "Kun J\nSingapore58 contributions\n0\nThe best cafe at Empire City\nAug 2025\nA wonderful new addition to the Empire City neighbourhood. Situated at Tilia Residences, opposite a green park, Nestling Cafe is everything a neighbourhood cafe should be. Great affordable menu that changes daily, excellent coffees, yummy smoothies and friendly staff. Also there is a toy shelf filled with books and high quality toys to keep the kids occupied. The outdoor area is great to just chill, covered and never windy or to sunny. It's quickly become my favourite cafe in Ho Chi Minh City\nRead more\nWritten August 15, 2025",
